<item name='HFText'><text>No</text></item>
<item name='HelpECategories'><text>2. Database Custodian Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Receiving and Reconciling Orders</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>2. Guide de gardien de base de données</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Receiving and Reconciling Orders</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>2</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>1</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='73%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>When the order has been received, the staff member responsible for the order is to forward the packing slips to the Section's Admin person.  When the Admin person receives this information, they have responsibilities to record information in the database for the received order.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.  Determine which items in the order were received and mark how many were received and that they were received.</run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1in' rightmargin='100%'/>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Note: if an order has been partially received, check the received items and leave the other ones not received.  The system will change the status to "</run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Partially Received</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>"</run></par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1.5000in' rightmargin='73%'/>
