><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='1.0021in' rightmargin='73%' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.  Do this by entering into edit mode while in the desired order by either selecting Edit from the Action Bar or double clicking on the order.</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3.  Indicate the Number Received and then click on the Received box.  An order will not change status from "On Order" to "Received" until the Number Received = Quantity ordered (see graphic above).</run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>4.  If all items for the order were received, you can also click on the Receive All button on the Action Bar.</run></par>
<pardef id='5' leftmargin='1.0118in' rightmargin='73%' firstlineleftmargin='0.8118in'/>
<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
