<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>5.  Fill in the Packing Slip information in the space provided at the bottom of the order.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
