<par def='5'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>6.  When the Invoice arrives, check the unit prices on the invoice against those on the order and change the order accordingly.  Also record any shipping costs and customs costs if applicable.  Also check that the appropriate currency was selected.</run></par>
<pardef id='6' leftmargin='0.8118in' rightmargin='73%'/>
<par def='6'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='6'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>7.  Check to be sure that the total value of the order in the database is the same as the total value of the order before taxes.</run></par>
<par def='6'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='6'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>8.  Record the invoice number and the date the invoice was received.</run></par>
<par def='6'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='6'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>9.</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  Include any additional comments, if desired.</run></par></richtext></item>
<item name='HelpFHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='7' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='73%'/>
<par def='7'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par></richtext></item>
